DESCRIPTION:I Am Jane Doe is a collaborative program presented by The Offi
 ce of Community Resilience and Officer Wellness\, Advocacy and Outreach a
 nd Greek Life to raise awareness about sexual assault\, support survivors
 \, and foster meaningful conversations about consent\, safety\, and accou
 ntability. Inspired by the Silent Witness tradition\, the program allows 
 us to shed light on stories that often do not receive the attention they 
 deserve and the difficulty survivors face when reporting. This program pr
 ovides an opportunity for our community to engage thoughtfully in convers
 ations surrounding sexual violence and its impact on individuals and camp
 us communities.\n\nHosted by: Advocacy and Outreach\, Greek Life\, Univer
 sity Police Department\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https:/
 /montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12844072
DTEND:20261026T150000Z
DTSTAMP:20261017T041211Z
