DESCRIPTION:DECA General Body Meetings (GBMs) are a place for students to 
 connect\, build professional skills\, learn about business\, and have fun
  with the DECA community. Each meeting includes an interactive activity\,
  game\, discussion\, or hands-on challenge focused on topics such as mark
 eting\, leadership\, hospitality\, finance\, entrepreneurship\, sports bu
 siness\, and customer service. Whether you are new to DECA or an experien
 ced member\, GBMs are a chance to meet new people\, learn something usefu
 l\, and get involved with Montclair State DECA.\n\nHosted by: DECA\n\nAdd
 itional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/eng
 age/event/12870297
