DESCRIPTION:Visiting the Pantry:\n1) Please have your Event Pass\, CWID an
 d have a PantrySoft Registration. 2) Please bring your own shopping bag a
 nd ID card!***Visitors are allowed to come once/week***\nOur Mission:  We
  aim to address food insecurity across Montclair State University. The Re
 d Hawk Pantry is open to all students\, staff\, and faculty at no cost. I
 f you are unable to visit during our regular hours\, please reach out via
  email at redhawkpantry@montclair.edu\nStay updated by following us on In
 stagram: @montclair_redhawkpantry\n Fall 2026 Hours\n\nTuesdays: 1:30-3:3
 0pm\nThursdays: 5-7pm\nSaturdays: 11-1pm\n\n\nHosted by: Red Hawk Pantry\
