DESCRIPTION:Bloomfield and Montclair Students - Take your voice beyond cam
 pus!\nJoin us for a Day in the Capitol\, a chance to sit in on state comm
 ittee hearings\, hear real testimony\, and see the democratic process in 
 action. You’ll tour the NJ State Capitol\, connect with legislators\, and
  advocate for your community. The best part? It’s all FREE (transportatio
 n + lunch included)!\nNetwork with like-minded professionals\, engage in 
 politics\, and develop a new perspective on the legislative process.\nDon
 ’t just learn about change… be part of it.\n📍 Transportation will be pro
 vided from the Red Hawk Deck on College Ave\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07043 and 
 from Bloomfield Campus\n\nHosted by: Civic & Voter Engagement\, Governmen
 t Relations and Community Affairs \, Office of Community Engagement and P
 artnerships\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.
 campuslabs.com/engage/event/12688182
