DESCRIPTION:Stroll for a Scare is a Halloween-themed Stroll for a Cause th
 at brings the Greek community together through entertainment\, philanthro
 py\, and collaboration. Participants will enjoy an exciting evening fille
 d with music\, strolling\, and school spirit while supporting meaningful 
 causes. Proceeds from event ticket donations will benefit the American He
 art Association and The Coalition Against Human Trafficking\, helping rai
 se awareness and support for their important initiatives. This event enco
 urages community service\, campus engagement\, and unity while celebratin
 g the Halloween season in a fun and festive atmosphere.\n\nHosted by: Ome
 ga Phi Chi\, Sigma Lambda Beta International Fraternity Inc.\n\nAdditiona
 l Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/ev
 ent/12869412
