DESCRIPTION:Wiss & Company LLP is a top 100 U.S. accounting and advisory f
 irm founded in 1969. Headquartered in Florham Park\, New Jersey\, the fir
 m operates additional offices in Flemington\, New York City\, and Boca Ra
 ton. Under the leadership of CEO Paul Peterson\, a specialized team of ro
 ughly 450 employees serves middle-market businesses and private clients. 
 Their comprehensive services include full-scale accounting\, audit assura
 nce\, strategic tax planning\, and outsourced fractional CFO solutions. F
 urthermore\, Wiss Private Client Advisors delivers specialized wealth man
 agement and estate planning services. Finally\, the firm drives business 
 modernization through targeted process automation and AI-driven data inte
 lligence.\n\nHosted by: Accounting Society\n\nAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12807380
