BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Social
CATEGORIES:Cultural/Community
DESCRIPTION:MoniCon is a 2-Day Event providing the full fledged Convention
  experience right here on Montclair State University's Main Campus! Here 
 at MoniCon we have a little something for everyone\, so you will not want
  to miss out on this one of a kind event! Some of our many activities wil
 l include\, Performances\, Cosplay\, Fursuits\, a Game Room\, an Artist A
 lley\, Panels\, Live Music\, and more! MoniCon is an event made by studen
 ts for everyone making it the perfect way to enjoy your weekend with an a
 mazing experience!\n.𖥔 ݁ ˖When & Where?.𖥔 ݁ ˖MoniCon will take place fr
 om November 7th through November 8th 2026 on Montclair State University's
  Main Campus. The event will encompase both the Student Center and Univer
 sity Hall Buildings. MoniCon's hours of operations are 11:30AM-10:00PM on
  November 7th and 11:30PM-9:00PM on November 8th.\n.𖥔 ݁ ˖How To Join?.𖥔
  ݁ ˖You can RSVP on any of the events labeled MoniCon\, you do not have t
 o RSVP to all of them in order to attend only one is ok! Event Passes wil
 l be eligable for purchase at the door and will be $10 for students and $
 20 for non students. If you would like to prepurchase a ticket online ple
 ase check out our EventBrite to secure your spot early!\n.𖥔 ݁ ˖About Us.
 𖥔 ݁ ˖MoniCon is created as a community effort by the Montclair State Fur
 ry Club\, Garfield Club\, Aurora\, Splatoon Club\, Montclair Univeristy G
 amers\, Art Society\, and Japan Club all in pursuits of making a unique a
 nd exciting event. If any of these clubs individually catch your eye chec
 k out their engage pages to learn more about the amazing oppertunities th
 ey individually bring to campus life.\n.𖥔 ݁ ˖More Information.𖥔 ݁ ˖For 
 more information about this event please check out MoniConvention on Inst
 agram or our linktree https://linktr.ee/monicon\n\nHosted by: Garfield cl
