DESCRIPTION:Interested in gaining hands-on professional experience\, devel
 oping leadership skills\, and expanding your network?\nJoin us to learn m
 ore about the 2027 Governor’s Hispanic Fellows Program\, an eight-week\, 
 stipend-supported summer fellowship that combines internships with leader
 ship and professional development opportunities.\nRegister on Handshake h
 ere: CHPRD Info Session Registration\nDuring this information session\, y
 ou'll learn about the program\, gain tips and best practices for submitti
 ng a strong application\, and connect with former fellows who are also cu
 rrent Montclair State University students and alumni!\nEligibility Requir
 ements:\n\nMust be a New Jersey resident\nMust be enrolled in a two-year 
 or four-year college/university or graduate program\nMust be available to
  participate throughout the summer program\n\nDon't miss this opportunity
  to grow your network\, build your skills\, and take the next step in you
 r career!\n\nHosted by: Office for Hispanic Initiatives\, The Office for 
 Experiential Education and Career Connections\n\nAdditional Information c
 an be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12879508
