DESCRIPTION:Cross-Curricular Robotics shows educators how to use robotics 
 to enhance learning across subjects. Participants will explore storytelli
 ng with robot “characters” in ELA\, measurement and angles in math\, hist
 orical simulations in social studies\, and concepts like force and motion
  in science. Through hands-on rotations with Ozobot\, Sphero\, and Dash\,
  educators will consider when each tool is most effective and design a le
 sson that integrates robotics in a purposeful\, content-driven way.\n\nHo
 sted by: The ADP Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https:
 //montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12714082
