  ask questions\, and discover what makes our organization so special in a
  welcoming and relaxed environment. After the informational\, stick aroun
 d for Karaoke Night!  Grab the mic\, sing your favorite songs\, and enjoy
  a fun evening getting to know the sisters and fellow attendees. Whether 
